---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout
  seo={{
    title: 'About Teepul - Handcrafted Luxury Curtains & Decor from Panipat, Haryana',
    description: 'Discover Teepul heritage in Panipat, Haryana — the Textile Hub of India. Learn about our master weavers, heavy thermal blackout curtains, French sheer window drapery, and artisan work culture.',
  }}
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f7f4ef] via-[#faf8f4] to-[#f4efe6] text-slate-900 overflow-hidden py-16 lg:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-amber-900/10">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#d4af37_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px]"></div>
    
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-amber-900/10 border border-amber-800/20 text-amber-900 text-xs font-black px-4 py-2 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-600 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>TEEPUL HERITAGE · PANIPAT, HARYANA</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 leading-[1.15] max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        Crafting Luxury Drapery from <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-800 via-amber-700 to-amber-900 bg-clip-text text-transparent">India's Textile Hub</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-slate-700 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium">
        Rooted in <strong>Panipat (Haryana)</strong> — globally renowned as the Handloom Capital of India — <strong>Teepul</strong> merges age-old textile artistry with modern architectural home aesthetics.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-4">
        <a
          href="/products"
          class="bg-amber-800 hover:bg-amber-900 text-white font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-amber-800/20 hover:shadow-amber-800/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>🛍️ Explore Collection</span>
          <span>&rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="#panipat-address"
          class="bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 border border-slate-300 font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm px-7 py-4 rounded-full shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>📍 Visit Panipat Studio</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3D Interactive Stats Cards -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 -mt-10 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 text-center space-y-1 group">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition">100,000+</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600">Meters Woven</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Panipat Looms</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 text-center space-y-1 group">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-amber-800">Heavy Weave</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600">Heavyweight Fabric</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">100% Thermal Blackout</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 text-center space-y-1 group">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition">10,000+</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600">Happy Homes</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Pan-India Delivery</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 text-center space-y-1 group">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-600">4.9 ★</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600">Customer Rating</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Verified Reviews</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- People & Work Culture in Panipat -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 space-y-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text Description -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-block bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 text-xs font-extrabold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest border border-amber-200">
          PEOPLE & WORK CULTURE
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 leading-tight">
          Master Weavers & Modern Craftsmanship in Panipat
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Panipat’s textile tradition stretches back decades. At <strong>Teepul</strong>, our strength lies in our people — local master weavers, textile engineers, precision tailors, and quality inspectors who work in tandem every single day.
        </p>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 font-medium">
          <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🚴</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-slate-900 block font-bold">Panipat Workshop & Cycling Culture:</strong>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs mt-0.5">Our artisans and team members cycle between yarn spinning units, dyeing facilities, and stitching workshops across Panipat's Sector 25 industrial zone, keeping our production eco-conscious and energetic.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🪡</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-slate-900 block font-bold">Hand-Checked Silver Eyelets & Stitching:</strong>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs mt-0.5">Every curtain panel is individually measured, double-stitched at the hem, and fitted with rust-proof stainless steel eyelet rings for smooth rod sliding.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Real Factory Workshop Visual Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-amber-900/10 shadow-2xl group bg-white">
          <img
            src="/panipat-factory-unit.jpg"
            alt="Ashank Ecommerce Private Limited Curtain Manufacturing Unit Panipat"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 aspect-[4/3]"
          />
          <div class="p-4 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-slate-900/90 to-transparent absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 text-white space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-[10px] uppercase px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full tracking-wider">
                PANIPAT UNIT SECTOR-25
              </span>
              <span class="text-amber-300 font-bold text-[11px]">Ashank Ecommerce Pvt Ltd</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-200 font-medium leading-tight">
              Skilled women artisans precision-stitching curtains & fitting stainless eyelet rings on JUKI industrial machinery.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We Work - Step by Step -->
  <section class="bg-[#f7f5f0] border-y border-amber-900/10 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-extrabold text-amber-800 uppercase tracking-widest bg-amber-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">PRODUCTION WORKFLOW</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-3">From Panipat Looms to Your Doorstep</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 font-extrabold rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-xl">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Yarn Selection</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Selecting 100% heavy polyester and linen fibers for high tensile strength.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 font-extrabold rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-xl">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Weaving & Dyeing</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">High-density weaving with azo-free eco-friendly color dyes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 font-extrabold rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-xl">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">Stitching & Eyelets</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Precision edge tailoring and stainless silver eyelet ring punch assembly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 font-extrabold rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-xl">4</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900">QC & Express Shipping</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Inspected, sealed, and shipped from Panipat with live tracking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 🎨 INTERACTIVE 3D ANIMATION & ROOM FABRIC EXPERIENCE SECTION (Panipat Textile Tech) -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950 via-amber-950 to-slate-950 text-white overflow-hidden py-16 sm:py-24 border-y border-amber-500/20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30 bg-[radial-gradient(#d4af37_1.5px,transparent_1.5px)] [background-size:32px_32px]"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
